  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp; be three given vectors. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is a vector such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></math> is equal to:"
