  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given data as below:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">j</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">k</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">j</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">k</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>It means&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;is parallel to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>From equation (1),</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>On putting values in equation (1) we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mn>11</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
